<title>SWITZERLAND: SAirGroup confirms four-mth statements.</title>
<headline>SAirGroup confirms four-mth statements.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>SAirGroup said business in the first four months of 1997 had lived up to and in most areas exceeded its targets.</p>
<p>In a speech prepared for delivery by SAirGroup chairman Hannes Goetz at the company's shareholders meeting there had been two slightly different statements regarding business developments during the first four months of the year.</p>
<p>One statement said the four-month performance had met expectations and the other said the performance had significantly surpassed expectation.</p>
<p>A SAirGroup spokesman clarified the discrepancy by stating that business in the first four months had lived up to, and in some areas exceeded, management's targets.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
